<title>CHILE: Chilean Apr retail sales up 0.1 pct vs 96-chamber.</title>
<headline>Chilean Apr retail sales up 0.1 pct vs 96-chamber.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean retail sales were 0.1 percent higher in April 1997 than in the same month last year, the National Chamber of Commerce said Wednesday.</p>
<p>But sales were up 2.9 percent in the first four months of the year in comparison with the same period in 1996, the Chamber said.</p>
<p>((--Paulina Modiano, Santiago Newsroom +562-6995595 x213)</p>
